{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-050",
    "title": "灯火之外"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_339",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "老人说：“因为他终于知道，别人替他写下的故事，不一定是他自己的。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "他们回到人间时，正下着一场很小的雨。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8552,
          "end": 8552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雨落在荒原上，落在裂谷边缘，也落在那些从天穹缝隙中飘下来的记忆微光上。微光没有被雨水打灭，反而在水珠里折出七色，像有人把漫长岁月磨成了极细的尘。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8554,
          "end": 8554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在裂谷旁，怀中婴儿已经睡着。孩子掌心那枚无齿圆环时隐时现，每次亮起，远处便有一颗记忆微光落向大地。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8556,
          "end": 8556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一颗落在一名老农肩头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8558,
          "end": 8558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老农怔怔站了很久，忽然想起自己年轻时曾有一个弟弟。弟弟死在三十年前的旱灾里，家中所有人都以为他从未出生。老农坐在田埂上哭了一阵，随后起身，在屋后种下一棵树。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8560,
          "end": 8560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第二颗落在一名正在赶路的少女手背。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8562,
          "end": 8562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她想起自己曾经救过一只受伤的白鸟，白鸟后来飞去了哪里，她已经记不清。她却忽然决定不再跟随父亲安排的婚事，转身走进了城里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8564,
          "end": 8564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "更多记忆微光落向人间。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8566,
          "end": 8566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "有些人接住了，有些人避开了。没有天庭替他们解释，也没有归墟盟替他们整理。每个人都必须自己面对那些突然归来的片段。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8568,
          "end": 8568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这样真的好吗？”萧问蝉站在雨里问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8570,
          "end": 8570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她已经不再穿白甲，手腕上的天庭金光也彻底消失。可她仍不习惯没有命令的日子，常常在清晨醒来，不知道今日该去追谁。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8572,
          "end": 8572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把一柄新剑递给她：“先学会决定自己要做什么。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8574,
          "end": 8574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果我做错呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8576,
          "end": 8576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就承担。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8578,
          "end": 8578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "萧问蝉握住剑，过了很久才点头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8580,
          "end": 8580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离坐在一块青石上，铜镜横放膝头。镜面裂纹没有修复，却能映出婴儿的睡脸。她看了很久，忽然问陆照临：“他有名字吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8582,
          "end": 8582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摇头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8584,
          "end": 8584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就一直叫编号七？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8586,
          "end": 8586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时不用名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8588,
          "end": 8588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离想了想：“总要有一天，他自己选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8590,
          "end": 8590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“嗯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8592,
          "end": 8592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们没有再回归墟旧址，而是在北境的裂谷旁搭起一座简陋的木屋。沈砚秋把白骨书埋在屋后，重新制作了一本普通的册子，封面改写为四个字：《太虚遗录》。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8594,
          "end": 8594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她不再记录谁应该被记住，只记录那些愿意留下故事的人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8596,
          "end": 8596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一位来找她的是阿七。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8598,
          "end": 8598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他已经不穿白甲，断刀也换成了一柄短斧。那场天庭崩裂后，他在附近村庄帮人修屋，村民问他从哪里来，他只说自己曾经叫阿七。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8600,
          "end": 8600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你准备换个名字吗？”沈砚秋问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8602,
          "end": 8602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“等我想好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8604,
          "end": 8604
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字很难想？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8606,
          "end": 8606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我想要一个不会被别人命令的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8608,
          "end": 8608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋在册中记下：阿七，正在选择名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8610,
          "end": 8610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这句话写完，远处忽然传来钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8612,
          "end": 8612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人同时抬头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8614,
          "end": 8614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天上没有天门，也没有倒悬宫殿。钟声却从每一片云里传来，像人间本来就有一座看不见的钟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8616,
          "end": 8616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临掌心的火线重新亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8618,
          "end": 8618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "它没有连接婴儿，而是指向东南方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8620,
          "end": 8620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向他：“还有门？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8622,
          "end": 8622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临闭目感知，点头：“不是门，是一段被留下的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8624,
          "end": 8624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋翻开《太虚遗录》，空白页上自动浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8626,
          "end": 8626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天庭已失其名，归墟尚有余烬，玄霄宗等待归人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8628,
          "end": 8628
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站起身：“我们该回去了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8630,
          "end": 8630
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "夜色降临，玄霄宗山门亮起第一盏新的引路灯。灯光没有指向天门，也没有指向某条被安排好的路，只照亮山脚一小段泥泞。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8846,
          "end": 8846
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们沿着灯光下山。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8848,
          "end": 8848
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "身后，山门石匾上的新刻文字在月色中清晰可见：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8850,
          "end": 8850
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门在心外，路由己行。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8852,
          "end": 8852
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "而更远的天穹深处，一道无人签名的诏书灰烬随风散去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8854,
          "end": 8854
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "没有人知道下一扇门会在何处打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8856,
          "end": 8856
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "但这一次，所有人都知道，门开之后，自己可以决定是否走进去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8858,
          "end": 8858
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山路上，雨后的泥土还很湿。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8860,
          "end": 8860
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走在陆照临左侧，偶尔替他挡开垂下的树枝。叶观澜和萧问蝉在前方探路，沈砚秋则边走边在册中补写沿途遇见的人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8862,
          "end": 8862
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们经过一座小村时，村口的老人正在给孩子讲故事。老人说，天上曾有一座宫殿，宫殿里住着一个没有名字的神。神后来学会了哭，于是天上的雨落到了人间。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8864,
          "end": 8864
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子问：“神为什么要哭？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8866,
          "end": 8866
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人说：“因为他终于知道，别人替他写下的故事，不一定是他自己的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8868,
          "end": 8868
        }
      }
    ],
